# One line-ending policy for the whole repository: LF in the object database
# and in the working tree, except Windows scripts that must stay CRLF.
# Icons and preview binaries are never normalised or diffed as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
